title: Fields
---
# Every field

Before the form, a [link](a.8tml).

:::form get /search
? text q Search
? text a
? text b value="hi there" max=5 A label that is quite long and wraps around the box
? password p value=abc Pw
? area m rows=2
? area m2 rows=3 max=100 Your message, please
? check c checked Tick [a link](x.8tml) here
? check c2 value=yes Not ticked
? radio r value=1 checked One
? radio r value=2 [ ] spaced label that goes on and on to wrap it
? select s Pick
- 1 One
+ 2 *Two* longer
- 3
? select e
? select long A select with long options
- a An option label that is far too long to fit in a box
- b Short
? submit
? submit go value=ok Go *now*
? reset r2 Clear <red>all</>
? hidden h value=1 hid
? bogus x
?
? text t max=0 rows=x checked label
- not an option (a list item now)
:::

? not a field outside a form

* a list after the form
